      "proseText": "You What are the opening hours of the pool, gym and spa? Check the property-knowledge-base. property-knowledge-base The pool and gym are open 06:00 to 22:00. The spa is open 09:00 to 20:00, and in season it's best to book treatments at least a day ahead. You Is late check-out possible? Yes, late check-out is possible. Standard check-out is 11:00, and late check-out extends it to 14:00, subject to availability. The front desk confirms it on the day, so I can check with them if you tell me your departure date. You Thanks, that's all. You're welcome. Enjoy your stay at the Grand Meridian, and let us know if you need anything else. Done Start over",
